  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_\n\n**`isValidRange`가 길이 초과 값을 유효로 판단할 수 있습니다.**\n\n현재 로직은 `maxLength`를 넘는 경우도 `true`로 떨어집니다. 이 함수가 의도대로 “허용 길이 범위”를 검증하는지 다시 확인하고, 초과 길이를 명시적으로 실패 처리하도록 조건을 재구성해 주세요.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@my-app/src/utils/Validation.ts` around lines 10 - 13, The isValidRange\nfunction currently has inverted logic and treats lengths greater than maxLength\nas valid; update isValidRange so it explicitly fails when value.length >\nmaxLength and only returns true when value.length is within the allowed range\n(e.g., 0 <= value.length <= maxLength). Locate and change the conditional in\nisValidRange to check for overflow (value.length > maxLength) and return false\nin that case, otherwise return true, ensuring the function name isValidRange\nstill reflects this corrected behavior.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk:e22bc73d-fa60-404c-ab2d-460f346c2974 -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
